---
import SocialList from "@/components/SocialList.astro";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<PageLayout
	searchable
	meta={{
		title: "About",
		description:
			"Graduate researcher at UC Merced studying collective cell dynamics, multicellular networks, cell adhesion, and pattern formation",
	}}
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl pb-16">
		<section aria-label="Introduction" class="mb-12">
			<div class="grid items-start gap-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_12rem] md:gap-12">
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<h1 class="sr-only">Suraj Sahu</h1>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-5 leading-relaxed">
						I am a graduate researcher in the <a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="http://gopinathanlab.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">Gopinathan Lab</a
						> at the <a
							class="cactus-link"
							href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">University of California, Merced</a
						>. My curiosity lies at the interface of biology and physics. More recently, I have
						started thinking about the mechanics of learning.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-5 leading-relaxed">
						My research focuses on the collective dynamics of cell–cell and cell–matrix interactions,
						including multicellular network formation, cell adhesion, and pattern formation. I use
						agent-based modeling, numerical methods, network analysis, and network mechanics, along
						with some image analysis.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-5 leading-relaxed">
						Beyond my research, I develop agentic tools and reusable workflows for reproducible
						computation and AI-assisted image analysis, including Cellpose-MCP. I have led workshops
						on AI tools and research skills, taught physics, and organized hands-on STEM outreach,
						from exploring microorganisms with Foldscope to teaching electrical circuits to middle
						school students. I have also mentored graduate students through GradExcel, served as
						president of the Graduate Biophysics Club, and contributed to the CEMB Trainee Leadership
						Council, helping organize professional development workshops and networking events.
					</p>
					<nav aria-label="Social profiles" class="mt-6 flex justify-start">
						<SocialList />
					</nav>
				</div>
				<figure class="w-36 md:w-full">
					<img
						src="/icons/profile.jpg"
						alt="Suraj Sahu"
						width="192"
						height="192"
						class="aspect-square w-full rounded-lg bg-gray-100 object-contain dark:bg-neutral-800"
					/>
					<figcaption class="text-accent-2 pt-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider">
						SURAJ!
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<aside
			aria-labelledby="personal-note"
			class="border-link/20 border-l-link bg-link/5 mb-12 rounded-lg border border-l-4 p-6 sm:p-8"
		>
			<h2 id="personal-note" class="text-accent-2 mb-4 text-xl font-semibold">A Note...</h2>
			<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed last:mb-0">
				Some people might think that saying this could damage my career because it could make me
				seem unsuitable for work. But I have ADHD and OCD! There, I said it.
			</p>
			<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed last:mb-0">
				I do not mention this because I want you to lower your expectations of me or treat me
				differently. I mention it so that you can understand that my working style might be
				different from yours. Sometimes, the things I can do amaze even me. At other times, even
				moving is hard. I believe that our true potential comes from empathy and from an
				environment that helps us feel our best.
			</p>
			<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed last:mb-0">
				I will try my best not to let this hinder our working relationship, and I will be clear
				in our communication.
			</p>
		</aside>

		<section aria-labelledby="affiliations" class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-8 dark:border-white/10">
			<h2 id="affiliations" class="text-accent-2 mb-6 text-xl font-semibold">Affiliations</h2>
			<div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
				<div class="group flex items-start gap-3">
					<a
						href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener"
						class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white"
					>
						<img src="/icons/ucmerced.webp" alt="UC Merced" class="h-10 w-10 object-contain" />
					</a>
					<div class="min-w-0">
						<a
							class="cactus-link text-global-text hover:text-accent-2 font-semibold"
							href="https://www.ucmerced.edu"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">University of California Merced</a
						>
						<p class="text-global-text mt-1 text-sm opacity-75">
							Graduate Researcher, <a
								class="cactus-link"
								href="http://gopinathanlab.ucmerced.edu"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Gopinathan Group</a
							>
						</p>
						<p class="text-global-text mt-0.5 text-sm opacity-75">
							<a
								class="cactus-link"
								href="https://physics.ucmerced.edu"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Department of Physics</a
							>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<a
					href="https://cemb.upenn.edu"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener"
					class="group flex items-start gap-3"
				>
					<div
						class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white"
					>
						<img src="/icons/cemb.png" alt="CEMB" class="h-10 w-10 object-contain" />
					</div>
					<div class="min-w-0">
						<p class="cactus-link text-global-text group-hover:text-accent-2 font-semibold">
							Center for Engineering MechanoBiology
						</p>
						<p class="text-global-text mt-1 text-sm opacity-75">UPenn</p>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://ccbm.ucmerced.edu"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener"
					class="group flex items-start gap-3"
				>
					<div
						class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white"
					>
						<img src="/icons/ccbm.png" alt="CCBM" class="h-10 w-10 object-contain" />
					</div>
					<div class="min-w-0">
						<p class="cactus-link text-global-text group-hover:text-accent-2 font-semibold">
							Center for Cellular and Biomolecular Machines
						</p>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
